:: Chemical Imbalance - Barkeep - A certain undergarment 1
<<set _questId = 'A certain undergarment'>>\
<<set _quest = setup.getQuestState(_questId)>>\
<<if _quest.status == setup.questStatuses.hidden>>\
<<discoverQuest _questId>>\
The barkeep takes a quick look around and then leans in close. "Y'know, there actually is something that I could use your help with."

"You see," the barkeep continues, "my wife and I have been having a bit of trouble late at night. So, of course, I ordered the special piece of clothing that I thought would be useful to help spice things up, you know?"

[['"What do you mean, \'a special piece of clothing\'?"'|Chemical Imbalance - Barkeep - A certain undergarment 2]]
<<else>>\
    <<if _quest.status == setup.questStatuses.available>>\
        The barkeep still looks a little bit sad.

        [[Leave|Chemical Imbalance]]
        [['"Hey, I decided that I'll help you out."'|Chemical Imbalance - Barkeep - A certain undergarment 3]]
    <</if>>\
    <<if setup.isQuestObjective(_questId, 'collectOrder')>>\
        You ask the barkeep what he needed again. He looks confused. "I just needed you to go to the tailor and pick up my order. I didn't think it was that complicated a task."

        [[Leave|Chemical Imbalance]]
    <</if>>\
    <<if setup.isQuestObjective(_questId, 'returnOrder')>>\
        You place the bag on the bar. The barkeep quickly realizes what it is and moves it behind the bar.

        "Thank you so much!" the barkeep says. "This will make my wife so happy! Here, take this."

        <<completeQuest _questId>>\
        <<receiveQuestReward _questId>>\
        <<notify>>Quest Complete - A certain undergarment!<</notify>>\

        [[Leave|Chemical Imbalance]]
    <</if>>\
<</if>>\

:: Chemical Imbalance - Barkeep - A certain undergarment 2
"Whoa, whoa! Not so loud! I'm trying to be a little discreet here." The bartender takes another look around before leaning toward you and saying, "It's not important what the clothing is. I just need you to get it for me. I can't grab it myself since I have to man the bar. Can you help me?"

[['"Sure, I'll help you."'|Chemical Imbalance - Barkeep - A certain undergarment 3]]
[['"You know what, I'm actually too busy to help. Sorry!"'|Chemical Imbalance - Barkeep - A certain undergarment 4]]

:: Chemical Imbalance - Barkeep - A certain undergarment 3
A smile breaks out on the barkeep's face. "Really?!" he says. "That's great news! Thank you so much! All I need you to do is head over to the tailor and pick up my order. Just say it's for me, and the owner will know what to grab."

<<set _questStatus = setup.getQuestState('A certain undergarment').status>>\
<<if _questStatus == setup.questStatuses.hidden || _questStatus == setup.questStatuses.available>>\
<<startQuest 'A certain undergarment'>>\
<<notify>>Quest Started - A certain undergarment!<</notify>>\
<</if>>\
[['"Sounds good!"'|Chemical Imbalance]]

:: Chemical Imbalance - Barkeep - A certain undergarment 4
The barkeep looks a little sad. "All right, well, let me know if you change your mind. I'll be working here, like always..."

[[Leave|Chemical Imbalance]]

:: Silver Patchwork - Owner - A certain undergarment 1
<<if setup.isQuestObjective('A certain undergarment', 'collectOrder')>>\
  The owner doesn't seem to acknowledge you. Then, without warning, he walks away and returns holding a sealed bag. He doesn't even look at you as he checks his list of orders.

  Well, all you can do now is return the package to the barkeep.

  <<advanceQuest 'A certain undergarment' 'collectOrder'>>\
  <<notify>>Quest Step Complete - A certain undergarment!<</notify>>\
  [[Leave|Financial District]]
<<else>>
<<if setup.isQuestObjective('A certain undergarment', 'returnOrder')>>\
  You already have the package, so all you need to do is bring it to the barkeep, but one thing has been on your mind.

  "Hey," you ask, "what's in this package, anyway?"

  The owner actually stops working for a second to laugh. "Son, it's better if you don't know." Before you can say anything, the owner walks into the back room.

  [[Leave|Financial District]]
<</if>>\
<</if>>\


